From 765e49efcbfd00a79889b20ef7944c2cbfee75b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Suresh, Prashanth" <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 08:24:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] libva: Restore Android shim excluded/deleted from 2.23.0
 overlay

Upstream 2.23.0 deletes va/android/va_android.cpp, va/android/Makefile.am,
and the vaGetDisplay() declaration in va/va_android.h ("Remove
unnecessary Android code"), and ships a different Android.bp. Restores
the fork-local Android shim as a deliberate addition: mediasdk_c2's
mfx_dev_va.cpp and media-driver's cmrtlib both have real, load-bearing
dependencies on vaGetDisplay()/libva-android. Migrating those two
consumers to vaGetDisplayDRM() (upstream's intended replacement)
remains a real follow-up task, not covered here.

This commit exists so the manifest can pin this project directly to
the real 2.23.0 tag (dbf83dc3b1ce6bad46e1628aaf2da5ef731157b8) instead
of carrying the whole tag's tree as a single large patch -- only this
Android-shim delta and the va_log* macro restoration layered on top of
it need to live in utils_vertical now.

Tracked-On: NIACP3-1547
Signed-off-by: Suresh, Prashanth <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
---
 Android.bp                |  64 +++++++---
 va/android/Makefile.am    |  24 ++++
 va/android/va_android.cpp | 238 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 va/va_android.h           |  15 +++
 4 files changed, 322 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 va/android/Makefile.am
 create mode 100644 va/android/va_android.cpp

